      "Who Should Switch to a Vertical Mouse",
      "The Daily Office Worker",
      "Profile: 6\u20138 hours of mouse use daily. Spreadsheets, email, presentations, web applications. Wrist feels stiff or achy by mid-afternoon.",
      "You are the primary audience for vertical mice, and the ergonomic case is strongest for you. The cumulative hours of pronation create the most risk, and a vertical mouse directly reduces that risk. The MX Vertical or Logitech Lift integrates cleanly into office workflows, and the 2\u20133 week adaptation curve is manageable when your work is not precision-dependent.",
      "The Remote Worker Building a Home Office",
