      "The MX Vertical is the default recommendation for wireless vertical mice. Dual-mode connectivity (Bluetooth + 2.4 GHz Unifying Receiver), USB-C charging, 4-month battery life, and Logi Options+ software for per-app button mapping. It pairs with up to 3 devices simultaneously \u2014 ideal for users who switch between a laptop, desktop, and tablet.",
      "The 57-degree ergonomic angle and 4000 DPI sensor handle everything from single-monitor office work to multi-display creative workflows. For hand-size-specific scoring, see our guides for large hands (https://verticalmouseguide.com/guides/best-vertical-mouse-large-hands) and small hands (https://verticalmouseguide.com/guides/best-vertical-mouse-small-hands-carpal-tunnel).",
