      "Best for: Users who switch between tasks requiring different sensitivities \u2014 spreadsheet precision at 800 DPI, web browsing at 1600, ultrawide navigation at 2400. The visual DPI indicator adds genuine daily utility that other budget mice lack.",
      "How We Evaluate Budget Vertical Mice",
      "Our evaluation uses a 100-point scale weighted for what matters most at the budget tier:",
      "Category Weight What We Assess",
