      "The distance your hand spans across the mouse body. For small hands, this must be under 65 mm. At 65 mm, a hand that is 2.75 inches (70 mm) wide can wrap around the mouse with fingers naturally curved \u2014 not splayed. Above 70 mm grip width, small hands are forced open and fatigue quickly.",
