    title: "Do Vertical Mice Actually Help Wrist Pain? (2026)",
    description: "Do vertical mice help wrist pain? We review the clinical evidence, who benefits most, who does not, and how they compare to 4 alternative solutions. Read \u2192",
    intent: "commercial",
